msgid "Welcome to Saifdora"
msgstr "Bienvenido a Saifdora"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Anterior"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "Siguiente"

msgid "NVIDIA graphics card detected! Official drivers are not installed."
msgstr ""
"¡Tarjeta NVIDIA detectada! Los controladores oficiales no están instalados."

msgid "Install NVIDIA & CUDA Driver"
msgstr "Instalar controlador NVIDIA y CUDA"

msgid "Show on startup"
msgstr "Mostrar al inicio"

msgid "Ready Out of the Box"
msgstr "Listo para usar"

msgid ""
"Saifdora Silverblue 45 includes comprehensive codecs, hardware acceleration,"
" and essential utilities pre-configured."
msgstr ""
"Saifdora Silverblue 45 incluye códecs completos, aceleración por hardware y "
"utilidades preconfiguradas."

msgid "Multimedia & Hardware Acceleration"
msgstr "Multimedia y aceleración de hardware"

msgid ""
"Full codec support (HEVC, AV1, HEIC) and hardware video decoding for Intel "
"and AMD."
msgstr ""
"Soporte completo de códecs (HEVC, AV1, HEIC) y aceleración para Intel y AMD."

msgid "Curated Repositories"
msgstr "Repositorios preparados"

msgid "Flathub and RPM Fusion (Free & Non-Free) enabled out of the box."
msgstr "Flathub y RPM Fusion activados por defecto."

msgid "Global Localization"
msgstr "Localización global"

msgid ""
"Full support for 12 languages with completed GNOME 51 translations and "
"international fonts."
msgstr ""
"Soporte completo para 12 idiomas con traducciones y fuentes de GNOME 51."

msgid "Archiving & Documents"
msgstr "Compresión y documentos"

msgid ""
"Integrated support for 7-Zip, RAR, ZIP, PDF tools, and high-performance "
"image processing."
msgstr ""
"Compatibilidad integrada con 7-Zip, RAR, ZIP y procesamiento de documentos."

msgid "Integrated Productivity Apps"
msgstr "Aplicaciones de productividad integradas"

msgid ""
"High-performance desktop applications installed natively in your system."
msgstr "Aplicaciones de escritorio nativas y de alto rendimiento."

msgid "Rumman (File & Media Converter)"
msgstr "Rumman (Convertidor de medios y archivos)"

msgid "High-performance media converter and file optimizer."
msgstr "Convertidor multimedia rápido y optimizador de archivos."

msgid "Launch Rumman"
msgstr "Ejecutar Rumman"

msgid "Mister Download Manager"
msgstr "Mister Download Manager"

msgid "Fast download manager automatically integrated with Firefox."
msgstr "Gestor de descargas rápido e integrado con Firefox."

msgid "Launch MDM"
msgstr "Ejecutar MDM"

msgid "ZapFast"
msgstr "ZapFast"

msgid "Fast native desktop WhatsApp client built with Rust."
msgstr "Cliente de WhatsApp nativo y rápido para escritorio escrito en Rust."

msgid "Launch ZapFast"
msgstr "Ejecutar ZapFast"

msgid "Interface Customization & Extensions"
msgstr "Personalización y extensiones"

msgid ""
"Enhance and personalize your GNOME desktop with pre-configured extensions "
"and utilities."
msgstr ""
"Personaliza tu escritorio GNOME con extensiones y utilidades listas para "
"usar."

msgid "Pre-Activated Extensions"
msgstr "Extensiones preactivadas"

msgid "ArcMenu, Dash to Dock, Clipboard Indicator, and Adwaita Lock Clock."
msgstr "ArcMenu, Dash to Dock, Clipboard Indicator y Adwaita Lock Clock."

msgid "Extension Manager"
msgstr "Gestor de extensiones"

msgid "Search, install, and update GNOME Shell extensions seamlessly."
msgstr "Busca, instala y actualiza extensiones de GNOME Shell fácilmente."

msgid "Manage Extensions"
msgstr "Gestionar extensiones"

msgid "Refine"
msgstr "Refine"

msgid "Tweak hidden GNOME settings, fonts, and desktop behavior."
msgstr "Ajusta opciones ocultas de GNOME, fuentes y comportamiento."

msgid "Customize Desktop"
msgstr "Personalizar escritorio"

msgid "Hardware & Graphics Drivers"
msgstr "Hardware y controladores gráficos"

msgid ""
"Optimized for smooth performance across Intel, AMD, and NVIDIA hardware."
msgstr "Rendimiento fluido en hardware Intel, AMD y NVIDIA."

msgid "Intel & AMD Acceleration"
msgstr "Aceleración Intel y AMD"

msgid ""
"Hardware video acceleration (VA-API / Mesa / Intel Media Driver) is pre-"
"configured and active."
msgstr "Aceleración de vídeo por hardware configurada y activa."

msgid "NVIDIA & CUDA Drivers"
msgstr "Controladores NVIDIA y CUDA"

msgid ""
"Detect your GPU model, install official drivers, configure CUDA, and manage "
"Secure Boot."
msgstr "Detecta tu GPU, instala controladores oficiales y configura CUDA."

msgid "Open NVIDIA Manager"
msgstr "Abrir gestor NVIDIA"

msgid "GNOME 51 Navigation Basics"
msgstr "Navegación básica en GNOME 51"

msgid ""
"Master simple gestures and shortcuts to move swiftly through your workspace."
msgstr "Gestos y atajos sencillos para desplazarte rápidamente."

msgid "Super Key & Search"
msgstr "Tecla Super y búsqueda"

msgid ""
"Press the Super (Windows) key to open the Activities Overview, search apps, "
"files, or do quick math."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa la tecla Super para abrir Actividades y buscar aplicaciones o "
"archivos."

msgid "Touchpad Gestures"
msgstr "Gestos del panel táctil"

msgid ""
"Swipe up/down with 3 fingers for Overview; swipe left/right with 3 fingers "
"to switch workspaces."
msgstr ""
"Desliza con 3 dedos arriba/abajo para ver actividades; izquierda/derecha "
"para cambiar de espacio."

msgid "Dynamic Workspaces"
msgstr "Espacios de trabajo dinámicos"

msgid ""
"Workspaces are created automatically as you open windows to keep your "
"desktop organized."
msgstr "Los espacios se crean automáticamente para mantener el orden."

msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "Comenzar"
